    "The tables array is the current manually provisioned DynamoDB contract, also consumed by the Lambda handler and deployment contract tests; this JSON does not provision or import AWS resources.",
    "backend/template.yaml provisions only API Gateway, Lambda, IAM, CloudWatch logs/dashboard/alarms. It reuses the Cognito pool/client and four DynamoDB tables by parameter and does not create or manage them.",
    "The handler uses only existing Items/Activity/Archive indexes. It scans the small Users table for cognitoSub because no GSI_CognitoSub exists, and scans Activity for application-wide history because Activity has no GSIs.",
    "The existing activity table's itemId + activityKey primary key is authoritative; eventId is a regular attribute and not a table key.",
    "The frontend has no local database/demo adapter; application data goes through the Cognito-authenticated API."
